// Bake recipe of the `fx_acid` set (plan docs/plans/2026-11-09-effect-visualization.md §6.3,
// WP6a): `asset_baker effect-bake --recipe <this file> --sources-dir <dir holding the sources>
// --ledger docs/evidence/veo/ledger.jsonl --output-dir assets/effects`.
//
// Sources are named by their bare file names; each is cited by its ledger line in
// assets/effects/fx_acid.provenance.ron. Review: docs/evidence/effects/review/texture_review.md.
// - acid_crown: Veo clip (effect-veo, fourth attempt), a glowing splash crown rising out of
//   black. The clip's later frames spread droplets to the frame edges instead of dissipating,
//   and its first second has the splash column touching the frame's bottom edge, so 1.1 s to
//   2.15 s are used (the crown opening to its peak), letterboxed so the column stays clear
//   of the cell border; the effect fades it in and erodes it away.
// - acid_stain (review round 2, WP6c; replaces `acid_splat`, whose radial spike rosette read as
//   clip-art): two generated stills, top-down, an irregular puddle with a thin middle and a
//   thick wet rim; variants. One stain covers the whole reach; flecks reuse it small.
// - droplet: one generated still, a teardrop moving towards +x (tail to the left).
// - acid_glob (review round 5): three generated stills, side-on, of thick liquid flying
//   towards +x: a round glob with a blunt trailing bulge, a glob tearing in two along a thin
//   neck, and a stretched glob with a ragged tail; dark body, one small highlight; silhouette
//   key (`Solid`) so the dark bodies stay opaque (a luminance key left only their rims); variants
//   for the burst's globs (the round-4 review read one droplet sprite as identical stickers).
// - acid_bubbles: not shipped (both clips rejected, the WP's clip cap reached; see the review).
(
    set: "fx_acid",
    cell_size: 256,
    elements: [
        (
            name: "acid_crown",
            look: Emissive,
            source: Clip(
                file: "874eca1f-54ba-4c42-89e3-f4980b4a58b9.mp4",
                frames: 24,
                decode_fps: 24,
                from_ms: Some(1100),
                until_ms: Some(2150),
                framing: Letterbox(feather_permille: 0),
            ),
        ),
        (
            name: "acid_stain",
            look: Lit,
            source: Variants(pictures: [
                Still(file: "fx_acid.acid_stain.20261110T091626Z-1115729-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_acid.acid_stain.20261110T091833Z-1121960-1.on_black.png"),
            ]),
        ),
        (
            name: "droplet",
            look: Lit,
            source: Still(file: "fx_acid.droplet.20261110T004336Z-2243079-1.on_black.png"),
        ),
        (
            name: "acid_glob",
            look: Solid,
            source: Variants(pictures: [
                Still(file: "fx_acid.acid_glob.20261111T015700Z-3779566-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_acid.acid_glob.20261111T015727Z-3781340-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_acid.acid_glob.20261111T015751Z-3783637-1.on_black.png"),
            ]),
        ),
    ],
)
